<title>USA: TABLE - Humana Inc Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Humana Inc Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>HUMANA INC.</p>
<p>Summary of operating results for the three months ended June 30:</p>
<p>						 1997		   1996</p>
<p> Premium revenues	    $1,805,000,000	$1,578,000,000</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>  and special charges	    65,000,000	    54,000,000</p>
<p>Net income</p>
<p>  before special charges	 42,000,000	    35,000,000</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p> before special charges		  .25		     .22</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>  after special charges	  42,000,000     (95,000,000)(a)</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per share</p>
<p>  after special charges		   .25		(.58)(a)</p>
<p>Shares used in earnings</p>
<p>  per share computation	 163,158,000	   162,455,000</p>
<p>Summary of operating results for the six months ended</p>
<p>June 30:</p>
<p>						1997		    1996</p>
<p> Premium revenues	    $3,608,000,000	$3,318,000,000</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>  and special charges	   125,000,000	   135,000,000</p>
<p>Net income</p>
<p>  before special charges	 81,000,000	    88,000,000</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>  before special charges		  .49		     .54</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>  after special charges	  81,000,000     (42,000,000)(a)</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per share</p>
<p>  after special charges		   .49		(.26)(a)</p>
<p>Shares used in earnings</p>
<p>  per share computation	 162,980,000	   162,417,000</p>
<p>(a)  Includes special charges before income taxes of $200 million ($130 million, net of income tax benefit) or $.80 per share related primarily to the restructuring of the company's Washington, D.C., health plan, provision for expected losses on insurance contracts, closing 13 service areas, and discontinuing unprofitable products in three markets.</p>
